-What this repository delivers, who uses its outputs, key domain concepts, and critical journeys.
+- A .NET 8 ASP.NET Core service that pulls stock changes from a supplier feed API (`Supplier:BaseUrl`) into an in-memory `StockStore`, then writes a dated CSV snapshot to `Export:DropPath`.
+- Domain terms: `StockChange` (feed record, keyed by `ChangeId`), `StockItem`/`StockSnapshot`, watermark (latest applied `ChangedAt`), `SyncRun` (one execution, trigger `manual` or `nightly`).
+- Journeys: nightly sync at 02:00 local time (`NightlySyncWorker`); manual sync via `POST /api/stock-sync` and status polling via `GET /api/stock-sync/{runId}`, driven by `wwwroot/admin/`.
+- CI deploys `develop` to UAT and `main` to two production hosts (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`).
 
